{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You enter a dormitory, and this dormitory is haunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But don't worry, I've got some help for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maybe you are curious about what this is? This is an escape strategy casual game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you want to challenge yourself? Want to blow off some steam? Whatever you want, I can help you get it, as long as you lie down on this bed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Back to the topic, this is a horror-style escape strategy casual game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, players need to avoid the pursuit of fierce ghosts and find a dormitory suitable for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Develop the economy to build forts to defend against the monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, players can only build on the empty floor in the room. After the empty floor is clicked, the construction menu will pop up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, players need to selectively build buildings according to their own economic status and expand their advantages step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the player defeats the ghost, the game is won; if the player is eliminated by the ghost, the game is lost.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3432390?t=1743499264","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3432390?t=1743499264","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432390/8d0dd2b109651541d5ed1536e5c4ea410f5ad5be/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743499264","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432390/8d0dd2b109651541d5ed1536e5c4ea410f5ad5be/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743499264","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You enter a dormitory, and this dormitory is haunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But don't worry, I've got some help for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maybe you are curious about what this is? This is an escape strategy casual game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you want to challenge yourself? Want to blow off some steam? Whatever you want, I can help you get it, as long as you lie down on this bed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Back to the topic, this is a horror-style escape strategy casual game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, players need to avoid the pursuit of fierce ghosts and find a dormitory suitable for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Develop the economy to build forts to defend against the monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, players can only build on the empty floor in the room. After the empty floor is clicked, the construction menu will pop up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, players need to selectively build buildings according to their own economic status and expand their advantages step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the player defeats the ghost, the game is won; if the player is eliminated by the ghost, the game is lost.</p>","developers":["mihuangame"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432390/e575a89562c1dfab85d813d06f1f22cd1ef8f432/header.jpg?t=1743499264","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257112807,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112807/movie480.mp4?t=1742020773","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112807/movie_max.mp4?t=1742020773"},"name":"\u6d77\u5916","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257112807/14ca9cbdd24b57251aff123a9b9653ab08902305/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742020773","webm":{"480":"http://video.a